# Trips away from home (see docs/travelers.md). Facts: trip (journey, adventure, visit), trip_stage (going, there,
# heading_home), passing_through (yes for strangers), found_treasure and got_hurt (yes/no, on coming home), and on
# anyone lately back from one: back_from (journey, adventure, visit, none), found_treasure_lately, came_back_hurt.
# Words: [direction] (north, south-west...), [distance] ("a few hours' walk"). doing is the trip's kind while on it,
# heading_home on the way back, sheltering at night.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Setting out, and coming home.

== trip_setting_out ==
Off I go.
I'll be back in a few days.                    {trip=journey}
Going to see what's out there.                 {trip=journey, curious, w=3}
Can't sit still. Time for a walk. A long one.  {trip=journey, wanderer, w=4}
Off to the caves. Wish me luck.                {trip=adventure, w=4}
There's treasure down there somewhere. I can feel it. {trip=adventure, greedy, w=4}
If I'm not back in a week, don't come looking. {trip=adventure, pessimist, w=3}
Going to call on the neighbors.                {trip=visit, w=4}
Do I have to go? I suppose I should.           {homebody, w=3}

== trip_home ==
Home at last.
Home. Nothing like it.                         {homebody, w=4}
Good to be back. My feet don't think so.       {trip=journey, w=3}
I saw things out there you wouldn't believe.   {trip=journey, liar, w=3}
Back in one piece!                             {trip=adventure, got_hurt=no, w=3}
Mostly in one piece.                           {trip=adventure, got_hurt=yes, w=5}
Look what I found!                             {found_treasure=yes, w=6}
Rich! Well. Richer.                            {found_treasure=yes, greedy, w=5}
Nice folk, the neighbors.                      {trip=visit, w=4}
Talked their ears off. They didn't mind.       {trip=visit, chatterbox, w=4}

== trip_lost ==
I don't know where I am. Best turn back.
Lost. Brilliant.                               {pessimist}
This isn't the way, is it.                     {lighthearted}

== trip_found_treasure ==
A chest! Somebody's left this for me.
Treasure!                                      {extrovert}
Mine now.                                      {greedy, w=3}

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Met on the road: greeting, and "Where are you headed?"

== greet ==
[hello] Just passing through.                  {passing_through=yes, w=5}
[hello] Long road. Is it far to anywhere?      {doing=journey, w=4}
[hello] Off on a bit of a journey.             {doing=journey, w=5}
Mind yourself, it gets dark down there.        {doing=adventure, w=5}
[hello] Don't suppose you've seen any caves about? {doing=adventure, w=4}
[hello] Heading home. Finally.                 {doing=heading_home, w=5}
[hello] Come to see the neighbors.             {doing=visit, w=5}
Shh. Trying to get some rest in here.          {doing=sheltering, w=6}

== headed ==
Nowhere in particular.
Home. It's [distance], [direction].            {trip_stage=heading_home, w=5}
Home. [direction.cap] of here, [distance].     {passing_through=yes, w=6}
Wherever the road goes. [direction.cap], for now. {trip=journey, wanderer, w=5}
[direction.cap]. [distance.cap]. Just to see it. {trip=journey, trip_stage=going, w=5}
I've got there. This is it. Not much, is it?   {trip=journey, trip_stage=there, pessimist, w=4}
Looking for caves, [direction]. [distance.cap]. {trip=adventure, trip_stage=going, w=5}
Down there. Into the dark.                     {trip=adventure, trip_stage=there, w=5}
Over to the neighbors', [direction]. [distance.cap]. {trip=visit, trip_stage=going, w=5}
Why do you want to know?                       {paranoid, w=3}

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Talking a trip over afterwards (the travels chat topic).

== chat_open_travels ==
[listener], I just got back from a journey. Walked for days. {back_from=journey, w=4}
[listener], you won't believe what's down in those caves. {back_from=adventure, w=4}
Went down a cave and nearly didn't come back up. {back_from=adventure, came_back_hurt=yes, w=5}
Found a chest down there. A whole chest!       {back_from=adventure, found_treasure_lately=yes, w=6}
I went and saw the neighbors. Nice enough.     {back_from=visit, w=4}
I've been away. Did I miss anything?           {w=1}

== chat_reply_travels ==
Glad you made it back.
You're braver than me.                         {timid, w=3}
Next time, take me with you.                   {brave, w=3}
I'd never go that far from home.               {homebody, w=4}
I've seen farther.                             {wanderer, proud, w=3}
And what did you bring me?                     {greedy, w=2}
